                    <div class="custom-post-template-body default-blog-post-body col-8">
                        
                        <span id="hs_cos_wrapper_post_body" class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_meta_field hs_cos_wrapper_type_rich_text" style="" data-hs-cos-general-type="meta_field" data-hs-cos-type="rich_text"><p>We’re proud to share that we’ve been honored with a <a href="https://www.anthemawards.com/winners/list/entry/#!sustainability-environment-climate/global-awareness-campaign/ecological-footprint-calculator/1985/-1/619155" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Silver Anthem Award in the Sustainability, Environment &amp; Climate category</a> for our work on the <a href="https://www.footprintcalculator.org/home/en" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Ecological Footprint Calculator</a>, a global awareness campaign designed to help individuals and organizations understand and reduce their environmental impact.<br><br>The Anthem Awards celebrate purpose and mission-driven work that sparks real change. Winning this recognition highlights our ongoing commitment to storytelling and strategy that inspire global sustainability action.<br><br>Created in collaboration with the Global Footprint Network, the Ecological Footprint Calculator translates complex data into an intuitive digital experience, empowering millions of users worldwide to explore how their daily choices shape the planet’s future. This tool helps close the gap between awareness and measurable impact.<br><br>This achievement reflects the talent, creativity, and heart of our entire team, designers, strategists, developers, and partners, who came together with a shared mission: to make sustainability tangible, personal, and engaging.<br><br>We’re grateful to the Anthem Awards for recognizing this work, and to everyone pushing innovation forward in climate and sustainability.</p>
<!--more--><hr>
<p><strong>Is your brand ready to make a similar leap?</strong> Free Range specializes in helping mission-driven organizations amplify their impact. From rebranding to designing cutting-edge digital solutions, we can help you reach new heights.</p>
<h4>Book a Free Consultation Today!</h4>
<p>Let’s explore how we can partner to bring your mission to life. <a href="/meetings/paulhammond/availabilities" rel="noopener">Schedule a free 30-minute consultation </a>with our team, and let’s start building your success story.</p></span>
                        
